  "journal": {
    "north_road": {
      "title": "Secure the Northern Road",
      "text": "Bram rounded up volunteers at the north gate and, as usual, volunteered me. We built a barricade, mended the watch platform, lit the posts along the road and moved the supplies. Then the hillside came down across the path with a worker caught behind it. We dug him out; nobody was hurt. From the platform I saw it: a structure on the mountain beyond the valley that Orin says matches no record he has. We go tomorrow, carefully."
    }
